Bug: Product and Solution Facets Disappear After Switching Browser Tabs
Summary:

Product and Solution facets disappear from the Content Type section after switching between Chrome browser tabs while the F5.com filter is selected.

Environment:

Browser: Chrome (latest)

Page: Search Page

Filter applied: F5.com

Repro Steps:

Navigate to the Search Page.

In the left filter panel, select the F5.com filter.

Confirm that Product and Solution facets appear under Content Type.

Switch to another Chrome browser tab.

Return back to the Search page tab.

Actual Result:

Product and Solution facets disappear from the Content Type section.

The facet list reloads incomplete or incorrectly.

Expected Result:

Product and Solution facets should remain visible and consistent after switching tabs.

Facets should not reset, disappear, or change state unless manually modified by the user.

Impact:

Users cannot reliably filter search results by Product or Solution.

Inconsistent UI behavior impacts usability and search accuracy.
